# SOC 2 Trust Services Criteria (TSC) Mapping

## Purpose
This document maps organizational controls to the SOC 2 Trust Services Criteria (TSC). It demonstrates how existing policies, procedures, and technical safeguards align with SOC 2 requirements.

## Scope
This mapping covers the following SOC 2 categories:
- Security (Common Criteria)
- Availability
- Confidentiality
- Processing Integrity
- Privacy

---

# 1. Security (Common Criteria)

| SOC 2 Criteria | Description | Mapped Controls | Evidence |
|----------------|-------------|-----------------|----------|
| CC1.1 | Control environment | Information Security Policy, AUP | Policy documents |
| CC1.2 | Board oversight | Governance structure | Meeting notes, org chart |
| CC2.1 | Communication of responsibilities | Security Awareness One‑Pager | Training records |
| CC3.1 | Risk assessment | Risk Register, Sample Risk Assessment | Risk documentation |
| CC4.1 | Monitoring activities | Audit Checklist | Audit logs, reports |
| CC5.1 | Logical access controls | MFA, least privilege | Access reviews |

